  <section id=3D"quest-resources">
<span id=3D"id1"></span><h1>Quest Resources<a class=3D"headerlink" href=3D"=
https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/resources/quest-resource=
.html?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#quest-resources" title=3D"Link to this headi=
ng">#</a></h1>
<p>Access to Quest=E2=80=99s compute and storage resources is managed throu=
gh <a class=3D"reference internal" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern=
.edu/systems/coldfront/cf-project.html#cf-projects"><span class=3D"std std-=
ref">ColdFront</span></a>. To use Quest, <a class=3D"reference external" hr=
ef=3D"https://coldfront.it.northwestern.edu/" target=3D"_blank">log in to C=
oldFront <svg version=3D"1.1" width=3D"1.0em" height=3D"1.0em" viewBox=3D"0=
 0 16 16" aria-hidden=3D"true" style=3D"display: inline-block; vertical-ali=
gn: middle; fill: currentColor;"><path d=3D"M3.75 2h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h=
-3.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v8.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h8.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-=
3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0v3.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 12.25 14h-8.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 2 =
12.25v-8.5C2 2.784 2.784 2 3.75 2Zm6.854-1h4.146a.25.25 0 0 1 .25.25v4.146a=
.25.25 0 0 1-.427.177L13.03 4.03 9.28 7.78a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.75=
1 0 0 1-.018-1.042l3.75-3.75-1.543-1.543A.25.25 0 0 1 10.604 1Z"></path></s=
vg></a>, <a class=3D"reference internal" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northw=
estern.edu/systems/coldfront/cf-project.html#cf-projects"><span class=3D"st=
d std-ref">create a Project</span></a>, and <a class=3D"reference internal"=
 href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/resources/quest=
-resource.html?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#cf-quest-request-resources">request=
</a> the compute or storage resources you need.</p>
<p>Compute resources allow you to submit jobs to run code on Quest=E2=80=99=
s compute nodes, and storage resources allow you to store files on Quest=E2=
