<section id=3D"general-access-compute">
<h3>General Access Compute<a class=3D"headerlink" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.=
it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/resources/quest-resource.html?utm_source=
=3Dchatgpt.com#general-access-compute" title=3D"Link to this heading">#</a>=
</h3>
<p>A General Access compute resource grants users the ability to submit job=
s through the scheduling system (Slurm) to the General Access <a class=3D"r=
eference internal" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/que=
st/user-guide/slurm/slurm.html#partitions"><span class=3D"std std-ref">part=
itions</span></a>: <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=
=3D"pre">short</span></code>, <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate">=
<span class=3D"pre">normal</span></code>, <code class=3D"docutils literal n=
otranslate"><span class=3D"pre">long</span></code>, <code class=3D"docutils=
 literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">gengpu</span></code> and <code cl=
ass=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">genhimem</span></c=
ode>. For more information on submitting to these partitions, please see th=
e <a class=3D"reference internal" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.=
edu/systems/quest/user-guide/slurm/slurm.html#slurm-on-quest"><span class=
=3D"std std-ref">Slurm documentation</span></a>.  The compute resources ava=
ilable through General Access are shared by all General Access users and th=
erefore occasionally have high wait times.</p>
<p>Once a compute resource is active, you can find the Slurm account ID for=
 the resource in the Manage Resources section of the Project details page i=
n ColdFront.</p>
<p>Access to compute resources is granted for one year; access can be renew=
ed.  When a compute resource expires, access to that resource is revoked fo=
r all users.</p>
<a class=3D"responsive-thumb" data-lightbox=3D"group-gallery" href=3D"https=
://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/_images/ga_resource_account_info1.png" titl=
e=3D"" data-title=3D""><img src=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/_im=
ages/ga_resource_account_info1.png" class=3D"" width=3D"100%" height=3D"aut=
o" alt=3D"ColdFront resource view">
                </a></section>
<section id=3D"general-access-storage">
<h3>General Access Storage<a class=3D"headerlink" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.=
it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/resources/quest-resource.html?utm_source=
=3Dchatgpt.com#general-access-storage" title=3D"Link to this heading">#</a>=
</h3>
<p>A General Access storage resource grants users the ability to store file=
s in the <a class=3D"reference internal" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northw=
estern.edu/systems/quest/user-guide/filesystem/filesystem.html#allocation-d=
irectories"><span class=3D"std std-ref">projects space</span></a>. Members =
of ColdFront Projects that have access to General Access storage resources =
can read and write to a subdirectory of the folder <code class=3D"docutils =
literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">/projects</span></code> which will=
 have 1 TB of storage space.</p>
<p>In addition to the size quota, General Access storage resources limit th=
e total number of files you can store to 10,000 files per GB of quota. A 1 =
TB resource allows approximately 10 million files. Reaching the file count =
limit prevents new files from being created even when storage space remains=
 available. For more information, see the <a class=3D"reference internal" h=
ref=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/user-guide/filesy=
stem/filesystem.html#allocation-directories"><span class=3D"std std-ref">Pr=
ojects Space</span></a> section of the Quest filesystem documentation.</p>
<p>Each Project receives a General Access account ID. The storage folder wi=
ll be <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">/pro=
jects/&lt;account_id&gt;</span></code>.  The account ID is listed in the Ma=
nage Resources section of the Project page.</p>
<p>Access to storage resources is granted for one year; access can be renew=
ed.  When a storage resource expires, access to the storage is revoked 30 d=
ays after expiration and any remaining data is removed 90 days after expira=
tion.</p>
<a class=3D"responsive-thumb" data-lightbox=3D"group-gallery" href=3D"https=
://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/_images/ga_resource_account_info1.png" titl=
e=3D"" data-title=3D""><img src=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/_im=
ages/ga_resource_account_info1.png" class=3D"" width=3D"100%" height=3D"aut=
o" alt=3D"ColdFront resource view">
                </a></section>
<section id=3D"general-access-tiers">
<h3>General Access Tiers<a class=3D"headerlink" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it=
.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/resources/quest-resource.html?utm_source=3D=
chatgpt.com#general-access-tiers" title=3D"Link to this heading">#</a></h3>
<p>There are two tiers for General Access resources on Quest: Research I an=
d Research II. All resources start at the Research I tier, which provides s=
ufficient resources for most research work done on Quest. Users can <a clas=
s=3D"reference internal" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/syste=
ms/quest/resources/quest-resource.html?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#quest-ga-up=
grade">upgrade</a> a resource to the Research II tier if:</p>
<ul class=3D"simple">
<li><p>They plan to use more than 100,000 compute hours per year.</p></li>
<li><p>They need more than 1 TB of storage.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>General Access storage cannot be expanded beyond 2 TB. If you require ad=
ditional storage for your Project, please <a class=3D"reference internal" h=
ref=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/resources/quest-r=
esource.html?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#quest-priority-storage">purchase stor=
age</a>.</p>
<p>Because the file count limit is calculated per GB of quota, upgrading fr=
om Research I to Research II also increases the number of files you can sto=
re, from approximately 10 million to approximately 20 million.</p>
</section>
</section>
