/svg></a>. Support is available to the instructor at no cost. Teaching modu=
les for classes may be available based on availability.</p>
<section id=3D"classroom-compute">
<h3>Classroom Compute<a class=3D"headerlink" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.no=
rthwestern.edu/systems/quest/resources/quest-resource.html?utm_source=3Dcha=
tgpt.com#classroom-compute" title=3D"Link to this heading">#</a></h3>
<p>A Classroom compute resource grants users the ability to submit Slurm jo=
bs to the General Access <a class=3D"reference internal" href=3D"https://rc=
dsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/user-guide/slurm/slurm.html#partit=
ions"><span class=3D"std std-ref">partitions</span></a>, such as <code clas=
s=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">short</span></code>,=
 <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">normal</s=
pan></code>, <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pr=
e">long</span></code>, and <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><sp=
an class=3D"pre">gengpu</span></code>. For more information on submitting t=
o these partitions, please see the <a class=3D"reference internal" href=3D"=
https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/user-guide/slurm/slurm.h=
tml#slurm-on-quest"><span class=3D"std std-ref">Slurm documentation</span><=
/a>.</p>
<p>Access to Classroom compute resources is granted for 16 weeks; access ca=
n be renewed.</p>
</section>
<section id=3D"classroom-storage">
<h3>Classroom Storage<a class=3D"headerlink" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.no=
rthwestern.edu/systems/quest/resources/quest-resource.html?utm_source=3Dcha=
tgpt.com#classroom-storage" title=3D"Link to this heading">#</a></h3>
<p>A Classroom storage resource grants users the ability to store files in =
the <a class=3D"reference internal" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwester=
n.edu/systems/quest/user-guide/filesystem/filesystem.html#allocation-direct=
ories"><span class=3D"std std-ref">projects space</span></a>.  The storage =
directory has a 2 TB quota that is shared by all users.</p>
<p>Storage resources are allocated for 1 year and can be renewed.  When a s=
torage resource expires, access to the storage is revoked 30 days after exp=
iration and any remaining data is removed 90 days after expiration.</p>
</section>
</section>
