<section id=3D"how-to-upgrade-general-access-resources">
<span id=3D"quest-ga-upgrade"></span><h3>How to Upgrade General Access Reso=
urces<a class=3D"headerlink" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/s=
ystems/quest/resources/quest-resource.html?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#how-to-=
upgrade-general-access-resources" title=3D"Link to this heading">#</a></h3>
<p>To request an upgrade for an active General Access compute or storage re=
source, follow the steps below.</p>
<details class=3D"sd-sphinx-override sd-dropdown sd-card sd-mb-3">
<summary class=3D"sd-summary-title sd-card-header">
<span class=3D"sd-summary-text">Compute</span><span class=3D"sd-summary-sta=
te-marker sd-summary-chevron-right"><svg version=3D"1.1" width=3D"1.5em" he=
ight=3D"1.5em" class=3D"sd-octicon sd-octicon-chevron-right" viewBox=3D"0 0=
 24 24" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D"M8.72 18.78a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06L14.=
44 12 8.72 6.28a.751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018l6.25 6.2=
5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-6.25 6.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0Z"></path></svg></span>=
</summary><div class=3D"sd-summary-content sd-card-body docutils">
<ol class=3D"arabic simple">
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Navigate to the ColdFront Project that contai=
ns the resource you would like to upgrade.</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">In the =E2=80=9CManage Resources=E2=80=9D sec=
tion, click on the gray =E2=80=9CUpgrade=E2=80=9D button in the =E2=80=9CMa=
nage=E2=80=9D column of the Quest General Access Compute resource you would=
 like to upgrade.</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Fill out the following sections of the upgrad=
e request:</p>
<ul class=3D"simple">
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Justification: a quick overview of why the ad=
ditional resources are needed by the research.</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Overview of Computational Method: a summary o=
f computational methods being used.</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Summary of Computational Resources: an estima=
tion of the number of compute hours required by your research.</p></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Click =E2=80=9CSubmit.=E2=80=9D</p></li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">Your request will be reviewed by RCDS. When the u=
pgraded resources are available, an email notification will be sent. If the=
 request is denied, a clarification email will be sent requesting additiona=
l information. Denied requests require a new submission for the upgrade.</p=
>
</div>
</details><details class=3D"sd-sphinx-override sd-dropdown sd-card sd-mb-3"=
>
<summary class=3D"sd-summary-title sd-card-header">
<span class=3D"sd-summary-text">Storage</span><span class=3D"sd-summary-sta=
te-marker sd-summary-chevron-right"><svg version=3D"1.1" width=3D"1.5em" he=
ight=3D"1.5em" class=3D"sd-octicon sd-octicon-chevron-right" viewBox=3D"0 0=
 24 24" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D"M8.72 18.78a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06L14.=
44 12 8.72 6.28a.751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018l6.25 6.2=
5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-6.25 6.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0Z"></path></svg></span>=
</summary><div class=3D"sd-summary-content sd-card-body docutils">
<ol class=3D"arabic simple">
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Navigate to the ColdFront Project that contai=
ns the General Access storage resources you are upgrading.</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">In the =E2=80=9CManage Resources=E2=80=9D sec=
tion, click on the gray =E2=80=9CUpgrade=E2=80=9D button in the =E2=80=9CMa=
nage=E2=80=9D column for the Quest General Access storage resource that you=
 want to upgrade.</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Write a brief justification of why you need t=
he additional storage.</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Click =E2=80=9CSubmit.=E2=80=9D</p></li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">An email notification will be sent when the upgra=
ded resources are available. If the request is denied, a clarification emai=
l will be sent requesting additional information. Denied requests require a=
 new submission for the upgrade.</p>
</div>
</details></section>
<section id=3D"how-to-renew-resources">
<span id=3D"quest-renew"></span><h3>How to Renew Resources<a class=3D"heade=
rlink" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/resources=
/quest-resource.html?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#how-to-renew-resources" title=
=3D"Link to this heading">#</a></h3>
<p>Only General Access and Classroom resources can be renewed; Priority Acc=
ess resources must be replaced with a new purchase.</p>
<p>If the expiring Quest resources have enabled published research, please =
add the publication details to the =E2=80=9CPublications=E2=80=9D section o=
n the bottom of the Project page in ColdFront at the time of renewing any r=
esources. This is done by clicking the purple =E2=80=9C+&nbsp;Add Publicati=
on=E2=80=9D button on the right side of the section header, filling out the=
 form fields on the resulting page, and clicking =E2=80=9C+&nbsp;Add Public=
ation=E2=80=9D under those form fields.</p>
<p>Then request a resource renewal:</p>
<ol class=3D"arabic simple">
<li><p>In the =E2=80=9CManage Resources=E2=80=9D section, click the yellow =
=E2=80=9CClick to renew=E2=80=9D or the red =E2=80=9CExpired - Click to ren=
ew=E2=80=9D button in the =E2=80=9CManage=E2=80=9D column for the resource =
you want to renew.</p></li>
<li><p>The renewal form will populate with the information from the origina=
l resource request. Update the justification (Research Projects) or course =
description (Classroom Projects) as needed.</p></li>
<li><p>Click =E2=80=9CSubmit=E2=80=9D to submit your renewal request and ag=
ree to the Terms and Conditions of Quest usage.</p></li>
</ol>
<p>An email notification will be sent when the request has been processed. =
If the request is denied, a clarification email will be sent requesting add=
itional information. Denied requests require a new submission for the renew=
al.</p>
<p>If you are renewing before the expiration date, there will be no lapse i=
n access to the resource. If the resource has already expired, it will be r=
eactivated within 24 hours of the renewal request being approved.</p>
</section>
</section>
</section>


